  "updated_at": "2026-03-16",
  "bio": "Helen Aldous, based in Holmfirth, United Kingdom, is an artistic & medical tattooist renowned for her exceptional skill in the illustrative tattoo style. She is dedicated to healing through art and offers a unique approach that caters not only to aesthetic needs but also to those seeking solace and empowerment in the wake of medical challenges, particularly for cancer warriors. Helen maintains a strict protocol on cleanliness, ensuring that each client's experience is not only transformative but also conducted in the safest and most hygienic environment possible.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Holmfirth, England, United Kingdom"
}